    Deploy wizard: headline the intro price, move renewal disclosure to summary

    Plan/tier cards in the VPS and game-server deploy wizards now lead with the
    intro/first-term price (when a plan carries one) instead of the regular
    renewal price, plus a real, server-computed "X% off first month/term" badge.
    The "then $Y/mo" renewal figure moved off the cards and onto the Order
    summary step, worded to match the selected billing term (first month vs
    first term). Presentational only — lib/order.ts, lib/game-order.ts,
    lib/renewal-charge.ts and lib/intro-pricing.ts were read, not edited; every
    displayed number was already computed by one of those.

